feat(catbox): transport-layer uploader for userspace file sharing

Roadmap item 15 first half (lib only — admin UI button + file-tree
wiring follow). Adds a clean transport boundary so the upcoming
Userspace File Tree (roadmap item 7) can ship a "Share to catbox"
action without inlining FormData plumbing into route code.

backend/src/lib/catbox.ts — uploadBufferToCatbox()
  - 50 MB hard cap (catbox itself allows 200, we keep admin UI snappy).
  - Filename sanitization: basename only, control chars stripped,
    100-char cap.
  - Anonymous by default; CATBOX_USERHASH env enables deletion-capable
    auth without changing the call site.
  - 60s default timeout; configurable via opts.timeoutMs for slow links.
  - Response validation: rejects anything that isn't a canonical
    files.catbox.moe URL (catbox sometimes returns HTML error pages
    with 200, which would otherwise look like success).
  - endpoint override exists ONLY for test injection — production
    callers should never pass it.

Tests (10 new in catbox.test.ts, total lib tests now 71):
  - happy path: returns URL and metadata
  - filename sanitization: ../../etc/passwd -> passwd
  - empty-buffer / oversize early refusal (no network hit on oversize)
  - non-URL response body rejected
  - HTTP error surfaces excerpt
  - CATBOX_USERHASH env forwarding when set
  - userhash field absent when env unset

Build: 510 modules. All 71 lib tests pass.